# "This spell can't be countered. Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn." Bot1 casts it with X = 2 ({2}{B}: Mox Jet, Mox Ruby,
# Mox Pearl) at Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5) on turn 3, into Bot2's two open blue mana and Counterspell. The Counterspell may be cast
# at it (a spell is still a legal target) but does nothing (CR 101.2): the Turtle is -2/3 exactly, so a wrong X is seen either way,
# and by Bot2's turn 4 the effect has ended (CR 514.2) and it is 0/5 again.

